{"info": {"address1": "2, Rainey Park", "city": "Kolkata", "zip": "700019", "country": "India", "phone": "91 33 2486 4961", "fax": "91 33 2486 4673", "website": "https://www.evereadyindia.com", "industry": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "industryKey": "electrical-equipment-parts", "industryDisp": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Eveready Industries India Limited manufactures and markets dry cell batteries, flashlights, and lighting and electrical products in India and internationally. The company offers zinc carbon, alkaline, coin cell, and rechargeable batteries, as well as chargers; and plastic light-emitting diode (LED), brass, aluminum, and rechargeable torches; and portable lanterns. It also provides consumer lighting products, such as LED bulbs, LED battens, emergency LEDs, LED panels, LED downlights and spotlights, and outdoor and festive lighting; professional lighting, including indoor architectural, commercial, industrial, facade, and flood lighting; electrical accessories comprising surge protectors, extension reels, multi-plugs, doorbells, plug tops, immersion heaters, and dry irons; and mosquito racquets. In addition, the company is involved in distribution of electrical products; and trading of raw materials. It sells its products under the Eveready, PowerCell, Ultima, Shakti, and Uniross brands. Eveready Industries India Limited was founded in 1905 and is based in Kolkata, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bibek  Agarwala", "title": "Executive Director & Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 23600000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Shampa Ghosh Ray", "age": 48, "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2826000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anirban  Banerjee", "age":